### Register Alice
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Alice Developer",
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Login Alice - copy accessToken into {{token}}
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Create BDT wallet
POST http://localhost:8080/api/wallets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currency": "BDT"
}

### My wallets
GET http://localhost:8080/api/wallets/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Deposit (simulated)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/wallets/{{walletId}}/deposit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 10000.00
}

### Transfer - receiver must be another existing BDT wallet
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: transfer-demo-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "senderWalletId": "{{walletId}}",
  "receiverWalletId": "{{receiverWalletId}}",
  "amount": 500.00,
  "description": "Demo transfer"
}

### Transaction history
GET http://localhost:8080/api/wallets/{{walletId}}/transactions?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
